          <p class="feature-desc">
            Drag-and-drop interface for building complex analysis pipelines 
            with conditional branching, parallel execution, and error handling.
          </p>
        </article>
        
        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <span class="material-icons-round">schedule</span>
          </div>
