            Live progress tracking with resource utilization metrics, bottleneck 
            detection, and performance optimization suggestions.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
      
      <div class="pipeline-stages">
        <div class="pipeline-stage">
          <div class="stage-icon">
            <span class="material-icons-round">science</span>
